WEBVTT

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.280
Hey, what are YOU lookin' at?!

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:03.020
Well?

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:04.660
You looked at me a few minutes ago, too...

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:09.560
Sorry, buddy, but lend me some change.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.100
Hurry it up!

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:32.350
Touto Takanodai General Hospital

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:38.190
Kumi Mizutani

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:38.290
Do it.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.530
The anesthetic is working.

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:49.800
The operation wasn't successful because I wasn't skilled enough.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:54.070
It's not your fault. You're an excellent surgeon.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:55.200
Besides...

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:58.280
She'll be all better soon.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:48.220
It's done.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:50.630
Kurosawa...

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:53.030
You know, you really are...

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:58.060
...a man chosen by destiny.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.880
I'll take care of the rest in the usual way.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:18.250
I feel like it'll disappear...

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:23.980
...the instant I look away.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:29.120
I just kept counting...

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:34.560
...all the many traces of loneliness...

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:41.930
...that I'd vomited up.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:47.870
In this time that seems so dry,

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:52.980
...my heart is thrashing around and drowning.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:58.840
It takes those lies that make my head spin...

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.890
...and tears them to pieces.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:11.560
 And the place I lose my way in...

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:19.390
...is a dim, hazy world.

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:54.450
Ginger tea. With lots of honey.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.920
Ginger tea?

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:02.520
Yes. This is the best thing to warm you up when you have a cold.

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.330
Thank you.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.770
You were working again last night?

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.400
Out in that rain?

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:14.200
Without an umbrella?

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.380
I see... That's why you got the chills.

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:22.240
You should go see a doctor.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:27.480
Here's the address of a good hospital.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:32.160
But first, gulp down that ginger tea.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:41.350
Touto Takanoda General Hospital
Bus Stop

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.820
It's pretty swollen, all right.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.420
I'll prescribe some medication for you,

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:05.250
...so pick it up at the pharmacy window on your way out.

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:06.790
Okay.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:09.220
Anything else?

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.630
Is there anything else that's bothering you?

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:14.660
No, not really...

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:18.260
That's good, then. You've been blessed.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:21.040
There are kids who can't run and play at an age...

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:23.200
...when they want to play around the most.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:25.640
Yes, even in this hospital...

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:30.610
Here. Give them this at the window.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:32.180
Thank you.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.750
Take care of yourself.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:37.690
Next, please!

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:38.790
Green onions!

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:43.360
Wrap some around your neck! It might work better than the medicine!

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.200
Green onions?

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:52.700
This is enough for three days. Please take it after every meal.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:54.510
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:06.050
Sorry, could you hit three, please?

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.150
How did your job go at the police station?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:12.660
It was just a heart attack. There were no signs of narcotics.

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.200
Kumi Mizutani

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.500
What's it feel like?

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:23.970
Like I'm alive!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:26.240
It's all thanks to you, Dr. Kirihara!

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:30.310
No, you were the one who did the hard part.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:31.940
Doctor...

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:36.040
I'll try hard, too, so I hope the surgery goes well!

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:37.650
It'll be fine!

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:40.320
Just believe in the doctor, and everything will be just fine!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:41.150
Right, Doctor?

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.190
Sure.

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:46.390
Of course.

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:51.890
Lisa Kayama... The patient in room 405?

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.530
Yeah. Her operation is next week.

00:07:56.170 --> 00:08:00.370
But in her present condition, I'm not sure she'll even make it off the table.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.770
She has dreams, too...

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:06.340
I want to give her a future.

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:10.050
So, please save her... Use your powers!

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:12.420
Are you sure?

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:18.490
If we "cure" her before the operation, it won't help your reputation.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:24.400
I've had enough praise already. Thanks to you.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:32.370
I never believed in God or in Buddha... But something close to it exists.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:39.070
Something that gave me this power... The power to control life and death.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.240
Yeah.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.550
If that is what you call destiny...

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:50.760
If my destiny is to lend a helping hand to lives that are fading away,

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:54.220
...then I will keep following that destiny.

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:57.160
Do you have any leads on a donor?

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.970
I do. A man who was one of my patients.

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:09.130
He's... a man who won't be missed in this world.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:12.910
This is the strange corpse that was found last night.

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:14.920
Robin?

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:17.980
I have a cold.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:25.090
The police autopsy report lists heart attack as cause of death.

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:28.260
Usually, the case would end there.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:30.220
But he was a Witch.

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:32.330
Which means...?

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:36.870
When a corpse is identified on the police computer,

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:41.040
...that individual is checked against the STN-J's Witch list.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:48.310
If there is a match, the STN-J performs a second autopsy.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:56.090
But our autopsy results were completely different from the one the police performed.

00:09:56.830 --> 00:10:01.160
Cause of death was coronary necrosis. It was caused by a Witch's power.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:07.340
It's unclear whether another Witch got to him, or if his own powers went out of control.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:11.340
But why are the results so different?

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:14.680
Naturally, we considered the possibility that it might be a simple mistake.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:17.110
But there were others.

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:22.480
Looking at past records, there was a case similar to this one three years ago.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:27.550
What's more, the same person was in charge of the police autopsy.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:30.760
Kazuhiro Kirihara, a part-time coroner...

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:35.430
...who currently works at Touto Takanodai General Hospital.

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:41.660
Several of the corpses he had been in charge of were those of Mafia members.

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:47.900
It's pretty unnatural that they all died of heart failure or a cerebral hemorrhage.

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:51.370
He's so close to being on the dark side you can't tell the difference.

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.480
A legal way of getting rid of evidence, huh?

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:56.350
Using his position as the coroner.

00:10:56.750 --> 00:11:00.420
We can't be certain at this point in time, but the possibility...

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:03.320
...that Kirihara is a Witch, or is associated with one, is very high.

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:05.450
We'll target him.

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:26.650
So anyway, folks who don't give the money back...

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:29.310
...get extorted, extorted, and extorted some more!

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:34.480
And when that doesn't work...

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:38.590
...you know what happens then, don't you, Doc?

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.460
The money you borrow...

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:48.830
...gets repaid with your life!

00:11:53.280 --> 00:12:00.110
Well, anyway, it's all thanks to you that I can stay in business like this!

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:05.750
I really appreciate it, Doc!

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:07.180
Really!

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:12.330
A man that the world won't miss...

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:21.960
The two customers in back need their check!

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:28.270
Let's let him keep sleeping...

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:32.810
Forever.

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:33.810
Yeah.

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:41.280
I feel like crap...

00:13:57.930 --> 00:13:58.830
We're being followed.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:01.130
You think so, too?

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:04.090
Maybe the police have figured it out.

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:07.910
No, they don't look like the police.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:11.180
Why, then? Why are they after us?

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.650
Maybe it's me that they're after.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:17.420
Maybe they're after my power...

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.390
There couldn't possibly be anyone!

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:26.390
Nobody besides us knows about your power!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.020
I can't drink anymore...

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:30.600
What are you...

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:31.570
Idiot!

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:34.960
You dumb bastard!

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:53.380
Geez, they went inside...

00:14:57.560 --> 00:14:58.820
We have no choice.

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:02.030
Sakaki, you're the forward. Robin, support him.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:05.130
Karasuma and I will cover the front and the back.

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:08.000
Robin!

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:48.140
Freeze!

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:50.740
Both hands up in the air!

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:54.240
Who the hell are you people?!

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:58.580
Why would a kid like you...

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.390
I'm under no obligation to answer a Witch.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.080
Witch?

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:07.230
Keep him pinned!

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.090
You're gonna do it?!

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:12.130
Bastard!

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:14.630
If we don't get them... They'll get us!

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:25.040
Dammit...

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.780
You little punk!

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:30.480
Hurry up and do it! My arms are going numb!

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:38.150
That's strange...

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:39.730
What's wrong?

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:43.330
My power... My power isn't working properly.

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:45.620
What are you doing? That's not possible!

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:47.890
You can do it! Try again!

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:51.770
Robin...

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:53.370
W-What the...?!

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:02.080
O-Oh, it's a girl.

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:04.240
You're...

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:05.810
You!

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:09.290
What are you doing here?

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:13.720
I see... So you were the Witch.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.830
I can't believe it... You have a power, too?

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.950
Don't worry... It's just chloroform.

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:39.820
Go after them.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:21.820
To go on saving human lives...

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:25.030
That is the destiny that was bestowed upon me.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:29.430
But you've killed innocent people.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.540
They were sinners.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.030
And so I passed judgment over them. With these two hands.

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:38.080
You have no right to do that.

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:40.920
Hey, what's that?

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:42.540
A fire? A will-o'-the-wisp?

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:52.330
Turn yourself in.

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.250
S-Stop it. I understand.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:57.800
I will.

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:00.040
You can't!

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:00.970
Run!

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:01.830
Kirihara!

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:11.940
Karasuma, mission cut. I'm going in.

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:15.310
Robin!

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:23.360
Don't move. Hold still.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:26.320
It'll collapse!

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:41.300
Kirihara...

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:48.940
A Witch...

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:58.990
There are other people besides you and me who have been given powers?

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:05.360
How do they use their own powers?

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:11.130
Do they accept the destiny that was bestowed upon them?

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:21.040
I... To the very end, I will obey my destiny.

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:47.270
Will you obey your destiny?

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:50.140
My destiny...

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:00.180
K-Kurosawa...

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:05.190
Save that girl's life...

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:11.160
I promise.

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:30.940
K-Kurosawa...

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:36.980
Kurosawa!

00:21:56.010 --> 00:21:58.380
All done. You're almost good as new.

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:09.050
It's not clear when Kurosawa's powers had awakened,

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:16.020
...but he apparently had used them to treat many of Kirihara's patients.

00:22:16.870 --> 00:22:17.730
What about Kirihara?

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:20.890
He's in our custody.

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:44.610
Just how far back do I need to go?

00:22:44.430 --> 00:22:47.470
Tell me.

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:59.460
It's all so vivid that it hurts.

00:23:00.320 --> 00:23:09.350
The truth is, nothing can be shared,

00:23:09.030 --> 00:23:13.840
...so I never looked back.

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:19.210
...all those promises...

00:23:21.150 --> 00:23:25.610
...inside me eventually...

00:23:24.900 --> 00:23:31.410
...gave up on that light from some other time,

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:40.190
...like the light of a morning you can't return to.
